; Zone for ecole-test.fr — DEV / TEST ONLY (DNS ownership proof, verify.md §1).
;
; HOW TO USE
;   1. Register/seed a school whose contact email domain is `ecole-test.fr`
;      (e.g. direction@ecole-test.fr) and set it `provisional`.
;   2. On /ecole/verification choose "Enregistrement DNS". CertifyChain shows:
;          Nom    : _certifychain.ecole-test.fr
;          Valeur : certifychain-verify=<TOKEN>
;   3. Paste <TOKEN> into the TXT record below (replace REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN),
;      bump the SOA serial, save. CoreDNS reloads within ~10s.
;   4. Click "Vérifier" → the API resolves the TXT here → school approved.
;
$TTL 30
@   IN  SOA ns.ecole-test.fr. admin.ecole-test.fr. (
        2026062901 ; serial — increment on every edit
        60         ; refresh
        30         ; retry
        300        ; expire
        30 )       ; minimum
@                       IN  NS   ns.ecole-test.fr.
ns                      IN  A    127.0.0.1
@                       IN  A    127.0.0.1

; ── The ownership-proof record. Paste your token after the `=`. ──────────────
_certifychain           IN  TXT  "certifychain-verify=REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN"
